  "applicability": "Pages with functionality a single pointer can operate: links, controls, widget roles, tab stops, pointer handler attributes, draggable or editable content, embedded documents, or any script (which can attach listeners unseen).",
  "expectation": "One page-wide UNTESTED note (needs_review) on every page with single-pointer\nfunctionality; never pass or violation. A static page without any control,\nhandler, embedded document or script is not applicable: no note. A page\nwhose DOM query API fails records the rule as not run.",
